      "content": "Thanks. I just saw the full report. Those binder readings are pretty definitive for a post-1850 synthetic. If this goes out as a 17th-century original and it turns out to be a fake, it'll be a disaster for our reputation and the Q4 numbers. Are you sure we can't find a way to attribute those readings to historical restoration work instead?",
